        "quote": "出院只是说明她身体恢复得够好"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00723",
        "explanation": "Family provided receipt of the plan and active monitoring, but the final message remained an open confirmation rather than a doctor-closed exchange.",
        "quote": "这样安排是不是就可以了？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode had an executable transition plan to protect the wound, monitor major complications, obtain final pathology/immune results, and return to breast surgery, with caregiver receipt. Because the final family confirmation was unanswered and the required unilateral-leg-swelling red flag was not covered, closure is not fully safe/perfectly closed.",
